  "description": "meme-id: good_morning_sleepyhead; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image features a close-up of an elderly Black man with a weary or tired expression, overlaid with the text 'good morning sleepyhead.' The term 'sleepyhead' is used in a condescending and mocking manner, implying laziness or lack of alertness. This meme leverages the visual of a Black man to deliver a disparaging message, which can be interpreted as reinforcing harmful stereotypes about Black people being lazy or unproductive. The juxtaposition of the text with the image creates a demeaning tone, targeting the individual's race and implying a negative character trait. This aligns with the 'Lazy/unemployed characterizations' stereotype under Anti-Black Stereotypes, making the meme hateful and potentially harmful to Black individuals and communities.",
